config DRM_MSM_Z180
	tristate "Qualcomm Z180 2D Graphics Engine"
	depends on ARCH_QCOM || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on OF
	depends on COMMON_CLK
	help
	  This driver provides support for the Qualcomm Z180 2D graphics
	  accelerator found in MSM8660/APQ8060 SoCs. The Z180 is a vector
	  graphics processor that supports 2D operations like blitting,
	  scaling, and compositing.

	  This is a minimal driver that initializes the hardware and handles
	  interrupts. Full userspace API support requires additional work.

	  If unsure, say N.
